<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>3.4.<sp/>Open-Closed<sp/>Eye<sp/>Classifier<sp/>(`ORTEyeStateModel`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>**Lineage<sp/>&amp;<sp/>Provenance**:<sp/>Intel<sp/>OpenVINO<sp/>Model<sp/>Zoo<sp/>`open-closed-eye-0001`<sp/>(`open_closed_eye.ort`,<sp/>converted<sp/>to<sp/>ONNX<sp/>opset<sp/>14<sp/>/<sp/>ORT<sp/>fixed<sp/>optimization<sp/>format).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>**Network<sp/>Architecture**:<sp/>Lightweight<sp/>CNN<sp/>classifier<sp/>emitting<sp/>2-class<sp/>Softmax<sp/>probabilities<sp/>(`[1,<sp/>2,<sp/>1,<sp/>1]`<sp/>or<sp/>`[1,<sp/>2]`:<sp/>index<sp/>`0`<sp/>=<sp/>Closed,<sp/>index<sp/>`1`<sp/>=<sp/>Open).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>**Preprocessing<sp/>Pipeline**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>1.<sp/>Consumes<sp/>the<sp/>exact<sp/>same<sp/>$60\times60$<sp/>interleaved<sp/>BGR8<sp/>eye<sp/>crops<sp/>extracted<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>gaze<sp/>model.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>2.<sp/>Bilinearly<sp/>downsamples<sp/>from<sp/>$60\times60$<sp/>to<sp/>$32\times32$.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>3.<sp/>Normalizes<sp/>pixel<sp/>values<sp/>via<sp/>zero-centering:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>$$x_{\text{norm}}<sp/>=<sp/>\frac{x_{\text{bgr}}<sp/>-<sp/>127.0}{255.0}<sp/>\in<sp/>[-0.498,<sp/>+0.502]$$</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>4.<sp/>Packs<sp/>into<sp/>planar<sp/>NCHW<sp/>float<sp/>tensor<sp/>$[1,<sp/>3,<sp/>32,<sp/>32]$<sp/>in<sp/>BGR<sp/>order.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>**Output**:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Extracts<sp/>index<sp/>`1`<sp/>(`out_data[1]`,<sp/>clamped<sp/>to<sp/>$[0.0,<sp/>1.0]$)<sp/>as<sp/>scalar<sp/>openness<sp/>probability<sp/>$P(\text{open})<sp/>\in<sp/>[0.0,<sp/>1.0]$.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Default<sp/>blink<sp/>threshold<sp/>is<sp/>configured<sp/>via<sp/>`gaze/blink/openness_threshold`<sp/>(`0.50`),<sp/>with<sp/>calibration/validation<sp/>tests<sp/>enforcing<sp/>clear<sp/>signal<sp/>separation<sp/>($\ge<sp/>0.70$<sp/>open,<sp/>$\le<sp/>0.20$<sp/>closed).</highlight></codeline>
